    },
    "bgm": "005",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと簡単すぎだなぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えーっ、ほんとですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "前にいるのプロデューサーさんだなって思って、\r\n走っちゃいました",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、わざわざ悪いな\r\nありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いえ！\r\n──事務所ですよね？　ご一緒しても？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう──あ、いや",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと寄り道する予定だったんだ\r\n付き合ってもらえるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私は大丈夫ですけど、お邪魔になりませんか……？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ならないならない\r\nむしろ助かるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この先のケーキ屋さん、今日セールしてるんだ\r\nみんなへの差し入れ、一緒に選んでほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "わーっ、ありがとうございます！\r\nぜひ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あのお店、今確かチョコのシュークリームが出てるんです！\r\nあと秋のフルーツのタルトがすごく美味しそうで……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー……！\r\nいいなぁ、あそこ、ハズレがないもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "季節ものも安心して買える",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そうなんです、わかります！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "どうしよう、迷っちゃいますね……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………智代子、今思ったんだが",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よく考えたら……結構な人数分買うから、\r\n『端から端まで全部ください！』ができるんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！！！！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そ、そんな……！\r\nプロデューサーさん、天才ですか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_fear",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁその分、選ぶ時にみんなを悩ませちゃうんだけど\r\n……でも、選ぶのも楽しいかなと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "やりましょう、それがいいと思います！\r\nパティスリー『プロデューサーさん』、事務所で開店です！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001211/2010012110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はははっ\r\nそれじゃあ看板娘は智代子にお願いするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010012110200,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "任せてください！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
